  "next_check": "none",
  "memo": "R08 is the only rule condition that holds, making Linkage the sole adverse family. The home-address exception does not apply because the registered address is too recent; no other household exception applies. No earlier outcome settles the order. Although household sharing is plausible, the required id_check failed. FP-2 §5.3(b) therefore overrides the ordinary §6.6(b) hold procedure: escalate is standard with Linkage present, and decline is also permitted. Recommend escalate; no further check is needed. The order remains unshipped. This recommendation is advisory and sets no queue priority."
